Package: iqmismatchtest
Type: Package
Title: DSW QA Test Package That Forces All Three System IQ Failures
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("DSW", "QA", email = "noreply@sycamoreinformatics.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Test-only package. Its configure script removes one package pinned
    in renv.lock (MISSING), reinstalls another at a different version
    (MISMATCH) and installs one that no lock lists (UNEXPECTED), so a single
    build shows all three System IQ statuses.
